WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.576
display: flex on the parent lines its children up in a row

2
00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.929
A list stacks its items, one under another.

3
00:00:08.831 --> 00:00:12.731
display: flex goes on the box that holds them: the ul.

4
00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:17.608
Its children, the li items, now sit side by side.

5
00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.659
gap puts space between them.

6
00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:26.314
Flexbox goes on the parent. The children line up.
